  "description_ja": "「気軽に走ろうかい」を合言葉に、様々な種別を用意し、気軽に参加できるマラソン大会です。淀川左岸の河川敷道路を使い、ハーフマラソンから5km、10km、小中高生の部、ジョギングや仮装のパフォーマンスの部まで幅広い種目があります。市民の健康増進やスポーツ推進、生涯の生きがいづくりに貢献することを目指しています。",
  "description_en": "Under the motto \"Let's run casually,\" this marathon event offers a wide variety of divisions so that anyone can take part easily. Held on the riverside road along the left bank of the Yodo River, it features events ranging from the half marathon, 5km and 10km to elementary, junior high and high school divisions, as well as a jogging division and a costume performance division. It aims to contribute to citizens' health, the promotion of sports and lifelong fulfillment.",
